  "forbidden_contradictions": [
    "Do not change the protagonist identity between scenes or episodes.",
    "Do not transfer the protagonist's central problem, request, reaction, or emotional perspective to a supporting character.",
    "Do not force a dialogue partner into a scene that is naturally a monologue.",
    "Do not resolve a surprise problem inside the same scene in which it is introduced.",
    "Do not repeatedly use the same type of surprise event within one episode.",
    "Do not ignore unresolved state from preceding scenes.",
    "Do not place target language or CEFR level into the permanent series identity."
